# Next.js Patterns for Nside Template

## Use Server Components by Default
```tsx
// No 'use client' = server component (default, preferred)
export default async function Page() {
  return <main>...</main>
}
```

Only add `'use client'` for: useState, useEffect, onClick, browser APIs, Webflow JS re-init.

## Font Loading (Zero CLS)
```tsx
// app/fonts.ts — Inter + Open Sans (Google)
import { Inter, Open_Sans } from 'next/font/google'

export const inter = Inter({
  subsets: ['latin'],
  display: 'swap',
  weight: ['300', '400', '500', '600', '700'],
  variable: '--font-inter',
})
```

## Root Layout
```tsx
// app/layout.tsx — CSS import order
import '../styles/normalize.css'
import '../styles/webflow.css'
import '../styles/nside-cloneable-cms-template-db517e.webflow.css'
```

## Image Configuration
```js
// next.config.js
images: {
  formats: ['image/avif', 'image/webp'],
  remotePatterns: [
    { protocol: 'https', hostname: 'uploads-ssl.webflow.com' },
    { protocol: 'https', hostname: 'assets-global.website-files.com' },
  ],
}
```

## Loading Webflow JS Safely
Only load webflow.js when actual Webflow content with interactions is present:
```tsx
import Script from 'next/script'
<Script src="/js/webflow.js" strategy="lazyOnload" />
```

## Common Vercel Deploy Fixes
- `TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined` → missing `'use client'`
- `window is not defined` → wrap in `useEffect` or `typeof window !== 'undefined'`
- Images 404 → check `remotePatterns` in next.config.js
- CSS not loading → verify import paths in layout.tsx; url() must use `/fonts/` or `/images/` for public assets
- `c is not a function` → webflow.js needs jQuery/Webflow runtime; don't load it on pages without Webflow content
